  "body": "When initiating a fetch as part of the \"update the image data\" algorithm\nfor `img`, we should use the element's `referrerpolicy` attribute, if\npresent, to set the referrer policy on the request.\n\nSee https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1531 and\nhttps://github.com/w3c/webappsec-referrer-policy/issues/40.\n",
